cant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIOKA, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KUBOTA SUNAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORI YUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIOKA HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KUBOTA, SUNAO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORI, YUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIOKA, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An ion complex which comprises a water-insoluble polyion (P) and a water-soluble polyion (A) and which is insoluble in water and soluble in water-containing organic solvents. The ion complex is suitable for use as a coating material to be applied to various ionic substances (e.g., a substance having physiological activity such as anticoagulant or antibacterial activity).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un complexe ionique renfermant un polyions insoluble dans l'eau (P) et un polyions hydrosoluble (A), ce complexe ionique étant insoluble dans l'eau et soluble dans les solvants organiques contenant de l'eau. Par ailleurs, ce complexe ionique peut être utilisé comme matériau de revêtement devant être appliqué sur des substances ioniques variées (par exemple, une substance à action physiologique, notamment une action anticoagulante ou antibactérienne).</p></abstract><copyright>Us